{"seq":3,"slug":"withholding-collection-settlement-remittance","title":"代扣收取、卖家余额抵扣、退款冲销与平台汇缴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/withholding-calculation-collection/withholding-collection-settlement-remittance","wordCount":2885,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"代扣收取-卖家余额抵扣-退款冲销与平台汇缴\">代扣收取、卖家余额抵扣、退款冲销与平台汇缴</h1><p>一笔订单在买家付款后，流转税的钱已经在平台账上，但它并不属于平台——它只是从买家流向税局的过路资金。真正决定这条资金链是否成立的，是接下来四步：把税从应付卖家的打款里<strong>扣</strong>出来、把扣不出钱的情况<strong>抵</strong>到卖家余额、把退货带来的税额<strong>冲</strong>回去、最后按期<strong>汇</strong>给税局。四步中任何一步做成&quot;顺手净额&quot;，跨期对账就会出现无法解释的差额。本节承接 <a href=\"withholding-base-rate-determination\">代扣基数与税率确定</a> 定下的基数与税率，讨论钱在账上怎么走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-代扣收取的三个时点与视为供应商模型\">核心概念：代扣收取的三个时点与视为供应商模型</h2><p>代扣不是一次动作，而是三个时间上分离的事件，每个事件触发不同的会计与申报后果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>记账后果</th>\n<th>常犯错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>应计</strong>（accrual）</td>\n<td>买家结账、订单确认</td>\n<td>确认应交税款负债，尚未有现金</td>\n<td>用发货时点代替结账时点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>扣缴</strong>（withholding from payout）</td>\n<td>平台对卖家结算</td>\n<td>从打款净额中扣除，税款留在平台</td>\n<td>把扣缴额当成平台收入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>汇缴</strong>（remittance）</td>\n<td>申报期结束</td>\n<td>现金流出至税局，负债清零</td>\n<td>汇缴金额与应计口径不一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以欧盟的<strong>视为供应商（deemed supplier）<strong>模型为例，它的设计正是为了让平台只做资金通道。依据欧盟增值税实施条例（EU）282/2011 第 9a 条，当平台被认定为视为供应商时，发生两笔被拟制的交易：卖家向平台</strong>视为供给</strong>（平台取得进项抵扣权），平台向消费者<strong>视为供给</strong>（平台产生销项纳税义务）。同一基数、同一税率下，平台的净纳税义务为零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>buyer</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>seller</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{net}} = T_{\\text{out}} - T_{\\text{in}} = B_{\\text{buyer}} \\times r - B_{\\text{seller}} \\times r = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buyer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践含义很直接：平台扣下买家支付的税款、按不含税价向卖家结算、在自己的申报表里同时申报这笔销项与这笔进项。<strong>代扣税款不是平台成本，只是平台保管的他人资金</strong>。这也是为什么把扣缴额计入平台营收是严重的会计错误——它同时在营收和税基上虚增。</p>\n<p>英国方向从 2021 年 1 月 1 日起对境外卖家销售的低价值货物（内在价值不超过 £135）采用同类模型，由平台在销售时点征收并申报英国供给 VAT，判据是买家收货地而非卖家注册地（HMRC Notice 的相关规定）。美国的 marketplace facilitator 法则走向另一个极端：45 个州加哥伦比亚特区均立法要求平台代收代缴，但<strong>没有</strong>&quot;视为供应商&quot;的进项抵扣机制，平台纯粹是征收代理人，销项与自身进项无关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卖家余额抵扣-从打款净额到负余额处理\">卖家余额抵扣：从打款净额到负余额处理</h2><p>扣缴的技术实现是&quot;打款净额扣减&quot;——结算引擎在生成对卖家付款指令前，从应付金额里减去本期应缴税款：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Payout</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>seller-borne</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>backup</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Payout} = G - C - T_{\\text{seller-borne}} - W_{\\text{backup}} - A_{\\text{prior}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Payout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller-borne</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">backup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prior</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是成交总额（也是 1099-K Box 1a 的报送基数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是平台佣金，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>seller-borne</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{seller-borne}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller-borne</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是卖家承担的流转税，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>backup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{backup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">backup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 TIN 缺失时的 24% 预扣（IRC §3406），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{prior}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prior</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是历史欠款。</p>\n<p>麻烦出在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 小于这些扣项之和的时候。小额订单、退货期未结束的冻结、卖家账户被风控——任何一种都会让扣缴额无处可扣，产生<strong>负余额</strong>。工程上有三条可选路径，必须按卖家状态显式分流，而不是让引擎默认留一个负数：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[本期结算&lt;br/&gt;gross - fees - tax] --&gt; Q{净额 &gt;= 0 ?}&#10;  Q --&gt;|是| P[正常打款&lt;br/&gt;payout]&#10;  Q --&gt;|否| N[负余额&lt;br/&gt;negative balance]&#10;  N --&gt; R1[从卖家备用金/保证金抵扣&lt;br/&gt;reserve offset]&#10;  N --&gt; R2[滚动至下一结算周期&lt;br/&gt;rollover]&#10;  N --&gt; R3[转为应收并停用卖家&lt;br/&gt;receivable + suspension]&#10;  R1 --&gt; L[扣缴台账 entry]&#10;  R2 --&gt; L&#10;  R3 --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; RM[汇缴池 remittance pool]\">graph TD\n  S[本期结算&lt;br/&gt;gross - fees - tax] --&gt; Q{净额 &gt;= 0 ?}\n  Q --&gt;|是| P[正常打款&lt;br/&gt;payout]\n  Q --&gt;|否| N[负余额&lt;br/&gt;negative balance]\n  N --&gt; R1[从卖家备用金/保证金抵扣&lt;br/&gt;reserve offset]\n  N --&gt; R2[滚动至下一结算周期&lt;br/&gt;rollover]\n  N --&gt; R3[转为应收并停用卖家&lt;br/&gt;receivable + suspension]\n  R1 --&gt; L[扣缴台账 entry]\n  R2 --&gt; L\n  R3 --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; RM[汇缴池 remittance pool]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>预留金抵扣</strong>最干净：平台通常已按周期从卖家流水里预留一定比例的保证金，直接冲抵即可，不影响本期打款节奏。</li>\n<li><strong>滚动结转</strong>适合短期缺口，但必须记录账龄。滚动的负余额如果长期不清，实质是平台在替卖家垫付税款，构成对平台的应收账款，而不是税务负债的消失。</li>\n<li><strong>转应收并停用</strong>是最后手段，触发条件是账龄或金额阈值，且需要与风控系统联动。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键纪律是：负余额的产生<strong>不改变已发生的纳税义务</strong>。平台对税局的应计负债在结账时点就成立了，卖家付不出钱是平台的信用风险，不是税局的风险。把这两者混为一谈，最常见的表现是&quot;卖家余额不足就撤销代扣&quot;——这在任何一个 marketplace facilitator 辖区都是违规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退款冲销与跨期更正\">退款冲销与跨期更正</h2><p>退货的钱要退给买家，但税款已经或即将汇给税局，冲销的路径取决于退款发生在汇缴之前还是之后。</p>\n<p>欧盟增值税指令第 90 条规定，在价格被全部或部分退还、交易被取消或价款未被收取等情形下，基数应相应调减。这给了退款冲销明确的法律依据，但<strong>时点</strong>决定操作方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>申报期内冲销</strong>：退款与销售落在同一申报期，直接在当期申报表里减少销项，账务与申报同步，无额外动作。</li>\n<li><strong>跨期冲销</strong>：退款发生在税款已汇缴之后，则通过当期申报的<strong>负数调整行</strong>或专门的更正机制处理。IOSS（进口一站式服务）对低价值货物（不超过 €150）的远距离销售，明确允许在后续申报中做净值调整，而非每笔都去改历史申报。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>美国方向由于按州申报，跨期冲销的做法碎片化：部分州要求在当期申报中报告负数销售或退款调整（如 Texas 的合格退款在 buyers 提交证明后可在后续申报中申报为信用），部分州要求提交修正申报表。工程上因此需要按州维护一张映射表，声明&quot;退款走当期调整还是走修正申报&quot;，并带上生效日期。</p>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的分叉是<strong>所得税报送与流转税冲销互不同步</strong>。IRS 1099-K 的 Box 1a 是&quot;total reportable payment transactions&quot;的年度总额，<strong>不因退款、折扣、费用而调减</strong>；退款只在 Box 3 的支付交易笔数上体现。因此同一笔退货在两张报表上的处理完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>流转税侧</th>\n<th>1099-K 侧</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单售出</td>\n<td>增加销项基数</td>\n<td>计入 Box 1a 与 Box 3 笔数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期内退款</td>\n<td>当期销项基数减少</td>\n<td>Box 1a 不调减；Box 3 笔数不计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨期退款</td>\n<td>当期负数调整或更正</td>\n<td>不追溯修改已报送数字</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把两条管线强行合并去重，是这类系统最昂贵的设计错误——它会让 1099-K 报送额与卖家实际流水不符，而 IRS 的比对是按总流水做的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台汇缴-申报周期-币种与对账\">平台汇缴：申报周期、币种与对账</h2><p>汇缴是四步里唯一真正把钱交出去的动作，它的工程约束集中在三处。</p>\n<p><strong>周期与截止日</strong>。不同辖区周期不同，且常常随交易量分档：IOSS 与 OSS 申报表的申报与缴纳截止在申报期结束后的次月末；英国 VAT 通常按季度申报，截止为期末次月的第 7 日（电子申报与缴款）；美国各州按月、季度或年度申报，频率随应税额分档，截止日各州不同。系统必须能按辖区 + 分档规则动态生成<strong>汇缴日历</strong>，而不是硬编码一个统一的月初。</p>\n<p><strong>币种</strong>。税局通常只接受本币缴款，而交易币种来自买家。这意味着汇缴金额 = 应计本币负债，而应计本身经过两次换算：交易币 → 平台记账币 → 税局本币。欧盟与英国都公布了官方汇率使用规则（如英国 HMRC 月度汇率、欧盟对非欧元区交易使用欧洲央行季度汇率），要求使用<strong>指定期间</strong>的汇率而非实时汇率。若系统在汇缴时用当日汇率折算，就会产生与法规要求不符的差额。</p>\n<p><strong>罚息与滞纳金</strong>。平台迟缴的后果与卖家欠款无关，因为纳税义务人是平台自己。到期未缴部分通常按日计息（英国 HMRC 对迟缴税款按日计息），并可能叠加滞纳金。这类成本在账务上应计入平台自身的财务费用，而非向卖家转嫁的税款——能否转嫁是合同问题，不是税务问题。</p>\n<p>汇缴完成后必须做<strong>三方对账</strong>：申报表金额、银行付款凭证、代扣台账余额。三者对齐的等式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Remitted</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mtext>accrued</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mtext>reversed</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>Adjustments</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Remitted} = \\sum_i T_{\\text{accrued},i} - \\sum_j T_{\\text{reversed},j} + \\text{Adjustments}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Remitted</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accrued</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reversed</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adjustments</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>任何非零残差都要能追溯到具体的订单或调整分录，否则下一个周期的账只会更乱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现-可重放的代扣-抵扣-汇缴账本\">工程实现：可重放的代扣-抵扣-汇缴账本</h2><p>把四步固化成一个<strong>只追加、可重放</strong>的台账，是这个域唯一稳妥的数据结构。每一笔资金事件是一条不可变分录，账户余额由分录累加得出，而不是就地修改字段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E1[订单结账&lt;br/&gt;accrual entry] --&gt; L[代扣台账&lt;br/&gt;append-only ledger]&#10;  E2[结算打款&lt;br/&gt;withholding entry] --&gt; L&#10;  E3[退款&lt;br/&gt;reversal entry] --&gt; L&#10;  E4[汇缴&lt;br/&gt;remittance entry] --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; B1[税局应付余额&lt;br/&gt;tax payable balance]&#10;  L --&gt; B2[卖家应收/应付&lt;br/&gt;seller balance]&#10;  B1 --&gt; R[三方对账]&#10;  B2 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; RP[可重放快照&lt;br/&gt;replayable snapshot]\">graph TD\n  E1[订单结账&lt;br/&gt;accrual entry] --&gt; L[代扣台账&lt;br/&gt;append-only ledger]\n  E2[结算打款&lt;br/&gt;withholding entry] --&gt; L\n  E3[退款&lt;br/&gt;reversal entry] --&gt; L\n  E4[汇缴&lt;br/&gt;remittance entry] --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; B1[税局应付余额&lt;br/&gt;tax payable balance]\n  L --&gt; B2[卖家应收/应付&lt;br/&gt;seller balance]\n  B1 --&gt; R[三方对账]\n  B2 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; RP[可重放快照&lt;br/&gt;replayable snapshot]</pre><p>三条落地纪律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>每笔分录携带 <code>jurisdiction</code>、<code>tax_type</code>、<code>effective_rate_version</code>、<code>occurred_at</code> 四个坐标</strong>。缺任一坐标，跨期重算都无法复现当时的判断。这与基数管道要求的&quot;税率带生效区间&quot;是同一条原则的延续。</li>\n<li><strong>冲销用负数分录追加，不改原分录</strong>。退货、更正、汇率调整都走追加路径。原地修改会破坏审计链，也会让&quot;历史申报当时是多少&quot;这个问题永久无解。</li>\n<li><strong>汇缴分录必须引用申报表 ID 与付款凭证 ID</strong>。这是把内部台账与外部义务绑定在一起的唯一锚点，也是三方差额定位的入口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有了这个台账，&quot;代扣多少、抵扣多少、冲销多少、汇缴多少&quot;就是一个纯粹的聚合查询，而不是散落在结算、风控、财务三套系统里的口径之争。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代扣是<strong>应计、扣缴、汇缴</strong>三个分离事件；在视为供应商模型下平台净纳税义务为零，扣缴额是保管资金而非平台收入。</li>\n<li>卖家余额抵扣走打款净额扣减；负余额须按预留金、滚动、转应收三条路径显式分流，且<strong>不改变已成立的纳税义务</strong>。</li>\n<li>退款冲销按是否跨汇缴期分为当期调整与更正申报；流转税可冲减，1099-K Box 1a 不因退款调减，两条管线必须分开。</li>\n<li>汇缴要处理分档周期、指定期汇率与迟缴罚息；汇率用当日折算会产生合规差额。</li>\n<li>数据结构的底线是 append-only 台账 + 四个坐标字段 + 汇缴绑定申报表/凭证 ID，让四步都可重放、可对账。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章的上一节 <a href=\"withholding-base-rate-determination\">代扣基数与税率确定</a> 解决&quot;算多少&quot;，本节解决&quot;钱怎么走&quot;；下一章 <a href=\"../seller-reporting-1099/\">卖家报送与 1099 税表</a> 从这些台账出发，展开面向税局的表单生成与年度报送。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代扣收取、卖家余额抵扣、退款冲销与平台汇缴","id":"代扣收取-卖家余额抵扣-退款冲销与平台汇缴"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：代扣收取的三个时点与视为供应商模型","id":"核心概念-代扣收取的三个时点与视为供应商模型"},{"level":2,"text":"卖家余额抵扣：从打款净额到负余额处理","id":"卖家余额抵扣-从打款净额到负余额处理"},{"level":2,"text":"退款冲销与跨期更正","id":"退款冲销与跨期更正"},{"level":2,"text":"平台汇缴：申报周期、币种与对账","id":"平台汇缴-申报周期-币种与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现：可重放的代扣-抵扣-汇缴账本","id":"工程实现-可重放的代扣-抵扣-汇缴账本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"税务引擎计算管线：地址校验、管辖来源与舍入幂等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/withholding-calculation-collection/tax-engine-address-sourcing-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"1099-K 门槛与资格判定：gross amount、支付卡/第三方网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/seller-reporting-1099/1099k-threshold-gross-amount-eligibility"}}